nnamed Suit 006 is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by DeFoe. He is one of the agents stationed in Venice, Italy.\n\nHistory\n\nThis Suit escorted DeFoe and Grier to Prague, Czech Republic, following the battle in the Venice Huntik Library. [The Casterwill Client]\n\nTrivia\n\n• Unnamed Suit 006 is distinguished from Steel by having a more slender and aged face as well as whiter, wispier hair.","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:Unnamed Suit 006.png\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br>[[Suits]]\n| base   = [[Venice, Italy]]\n| gender = Male\n| hair   = White\n| eyes   = \n| first  = \"[[The Casterwill Client]]\"\n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 006''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[DeFoe]]. He is one of the agents stationed in [[Venice, Italy]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit escorted [[DeFoe]] and [[Grier]] to [[Prague, Czech Republic]], following the battle in the [[Venice Huntik Library]]. {{Source|The Casterwill Client}}\n\n== Trivia ==\n* Unnamed Suit 006 is distinguished from [[Steel]] by having a more slender and aged face as well as whiter, wispier hair.\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8056","status":"resolved","target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy","href":"#/categories?name=Venice%2C%20Italy"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2512","status":"re